\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li360\ri7812\sl244\slmult1\f0\fs20\b0\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100 Because Chain Calculations generate so many runs and potentially several megabytes of data, only torque and HP data is saved or displayed.\expnd8\expndtw40  \expnd0\expndtw0 Therefore Chain Calculations are most useful to do quick trials of specs and see the effect on performance.\expnd8\expndtw39  \expnd0\expndtw0 For\expnd-1\expndtw-6  \expnd0\expndtw0 detailed\expnd-1\expndtw-6  \expnd0\expndtw0 investigations, where\expnd-1\expndtw-5  \expnd0\expndtw0 you\expnd-1\expndtw-5  \expnd0\expndtw0 may\expnd-1\expndtw-6  \expnd0\expndtw0 want\expnd-1\expndtw-6  \expnd0\expndtw0 to\expnd-1\expndtw-4  \expnd0\expndtw0 check\expnd-1\expndtw-5  \expnd0\expndtw0 detonation, check valve toss, do Cycle Data graphs, you must use single calculations as\expnd8\expndtw40  \expnd0\expndtw0 shown in the first part of this example.\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li360\ri7824\sl244\slmult1\sb228\f0\fs20\b0\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100 The\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 graph\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 of\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 Figure\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 4.58\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 can\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 appear\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 very confusing, especially as printed here in black\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 and\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 white.\expnd8\expndtw40  \expnd0\expndtw0 However,\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 you\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 can\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 click on any run name in the graph legend and the corresponding graph will flash.\expnd8\expndtw40  \expnd0\expndtw0 This way you can see how each combination compares to all the others.\expnd8\expndtw40  \expnd0\expndtw0 If we do this, the combinations which appear the best\expnd8\expndtw40  \expnd0\expndtw0 in the RPM range around 7500 are:\par\pard\plai